## ℹ️ General Information

This playbook outlines the core behaviors and mindsets that help managers create an environment where people can do their best work[cite: 12]. Every principle in this guide supports psychological safety, clarity, and trust — the foundations of effective, people-first leadership[cite: 12].

Managers who listen deeply, set clear expectations, communicate consistently, uphold healthy boundaries, and lead with integrity create teams that feel supported, understood, and empowered[cite: 12]. These practices build a workplace where individuals can grow, collaborate, and perform at their highest level[cite: 12].

